sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant FP as FileProvider
    participant Other as Receiving app

    App->>App: export receipt -> app-specific storage (Ch 25)
    App->>FP: getUriForFile(file) -> content:// URI
    App->>Other: ACTION_SEND + FLAG_GRANT_READ_URI_PERMISSION
    Other->>FP: openInputStream(content URI) [temporary read grant]
    FP-->>Other: file bytes (that file only)
    Note over App,Other: no file path exposed - grant is temporary + read-only
